go 1.26.5

use ./platform-api
use ./platform-auth
use ./secrets-api

// Workaround for a Go 1.26 workspace module-graph-pruning quirk: when a
// workspace member module has its own non-trivial requires (platform-auth
// requires go-oidc et al.), `go build` in an importing module tries to
// re-resolve that member's go.mod over VCS to prune the graph, even though
// the member is already a `use`-d workspace directory. Pinning a replace at
// the exact placeholder version importers request (v0.0.0) makes the
// workspace-local directory authoritative and skips the network lookup.
replace github.com/tesserix/tesserix-home/platform-auth v0.0.0 => ./platform-auth
